@startuml State Management Pattern

title StateFlow 기반 상태 관리 패턴

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 10

participant "Composable\n(Screen)" as UI #E3F2FD
participant "ViewModel" as VM #90CAF9
participant "MutableStateFlow\n(private)" as MutableState #FFA726
participant "StateFlow\n(public)" as StateFlow #FF9800
participant "UseCase" as UC #FFE082
participant "Repository" as Repo #FFF9C4

== 초기화 ==

UI -> UI : onCreate()
UI -> VM : init()
activate VM

VM -> MutableState ** : create MutableStateFlow<UiState>(Loading)
VM -> StateFlow ** : expose as StateFlow

VM -> UC : invoke()
activate UC
UC -> Repo : getData()
Repo --> UC : Result<Data>
deactivate UC

VM -> MutableState : emit(Success(data))
MutableState -> StateFlow : propagate

deactivate VM

== UI 구독 ==

UI -> StateFlow : collectAsState()
activate StateFlow

StateFlow --> UI : UiState (Success)

UI -> UI : Recomposition\n(UI 업데이트)

deactivate StateFlow

note over UI
    @Composable
    fun Screen(viewModel: VM) {
        val uiState by viewModel
            .uiState
            .collectAsState()
        
        when(uiState) {
            Loading -> LoadingView()
            Success -> ContentView(data)
            Error -> ErrorView(msg)
        }
    }
end note

== 사용자 인터랙션 ==

UI -> UI : User clicks\n"Refresh" button

UI -> VM : refreshData()
activate VM

VM -> MutableState : emit(Loading)
MutableState -> StateFlow : propagate
StateFlow --> UI : UiState (Loading)
UI -> UI : Show loading

VM -> UC : invoke()
activate UC
UC -> Repo : getData()

alt Success
    Repo --> UC : Result.Success(data)
    UC --> VM : Result.Success
    
    VM -> MutableState : emit(Success(data))
    MutableState -> StateFlow : propagate
    StateFlow --> UI : UiState (Success)
    UI -> UI : Recomposition\nShow data
    
else Error
    Repo --> UC : Result.Error(msg)
    UC --> VM : Result.Error
    
    VM -> MutableState : emit(Error(msg))
    MutableState -> StateFlow : propagate
    StateFlow --> UI : UiState (Error)
    UI -> UI : Recomposition\nShow error
end

deactivate UC
deactivate VM

note over VM
    class ViewModel : ViewModel() {
        // Private mutable state
        private val _uiState = 
            MutableStateFlow<UiState>(Loading)
        
        // Public read-only state
        val uiState: StateFlow<UiState> = 
            _uiState.asStateFlow()
        
        fun loadData() {
            viewModelScope.launch {
                _uiState.value = Loading
                
                when (val result = useCase()) {
                    is Success -> 
                        _uiState.value = Success(result.data)
                    is Error -> 
                        _uiState.value = Error(result.msg)
                }
            }
        }
    }
end note

note over StateFlow
    **StateFlow 특징**
    - Hot stream (항상 값 유지)
    - 초기값 필수
    - 마지막 값만 emit
    - 중복 값 자동 필터링
    
    **UI에서 사용**
    - collectAsState()로 구독
    - 자동 Recomposition
    - Lifecycle 인식
end note

@enduml
